# MLB Betting System — Current State & Next Objectives

## Project overview

An MLB sports betting system with four prediction models (NRFI, HR, F5, K)
built on a shared `mlb_core` library. Currently runs as Jupyter notebooks
on a Windows machine. Goal: fully automated twice-daily runs on GCP with
Discord signal delivery.

