## Environment variable reference

| Variable | Required on GCP | Default | Description |
|----------|----------------|---------|-------------|
| `MLB_GCS_BUCKET` | Yes | (empty = local) | GCS bucket name |
| `MLB_DB_URL` | Yes | (empty = SQLite) | Cloud SQL connection string |
| `GCP_PROJECT` | Yes | `""` | GCP project id |
| `GCP_REGION` | No | `us-central1` | GCP region |
| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` | Yes | (empty = no Discord) | Webhook URL |
| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_NRFI` | No | falls back to above | Per-system override |
| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_HR` | No | falls back to above | Per-system override |
| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_F5` | No | falls back to above | Per-system override |
| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_K` | No | falls back to above | Per-system override |
| `MLB_BASE_DATA` | No | `~/Baseball_Data` | Local data root (dev) |
| `MLB_BASE_DIR` | No | repo root | Local repo root (dev) |
| `NRFI_BASE_DIR` | No | `<repo>/NRFI_Pro_System` | System root override |
| `HR_BASE_DIR` | No | `<repo>/HR_Pro` | System root override |
| `F5_BASE_DIR` | No | `<repo>/F5_Pro_System` | System root override |
| `K_BASE_DIR` | No | `<repo>/K_Pro_System` | System root override |

